{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The content is still in production and improving. This demo is mainly to let players feel the game flow; feel free to leave some feedback in the comment area :D</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I met a devil who wants to play a game with me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We will flip coins until one shows tails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once that happens, I can keep all the coins except for the one showing tails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All I need is to pay some coins in return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sounds like a good deal, doesn't it?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I flip a coin. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If heads, automatically flip another coin and repeat the process until tails. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If tails, I gain all the coins except for the one showing tails, and the round is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For every 5 rounds, the devil will charge me some coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can't wait to become a millionaire!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Devil's offer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every time the round is over, the devil offers three items for sale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I can use the coins I earned from the previous round to purchase those items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Those items will make my next round better!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The devil is too kind for me!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3633970?t=1744633080","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3633970?t=1744633080","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633970/e26f55b7f4a1f65ddfd68399678d7db371c71831/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744633080","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633970/e26f55b7f4a1f65ddfd68399678d7db371c71831/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744633080","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"The content of the game will show the player's blood splash in the form of a trade with the demon.\r\nPlayers might discover that the item's description contains a slight sexual innuendo.\r\nPlayers may find that the icons and descriptions of the items do not shy away from showing drugs, alcohol, and tobacco."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The content is still in production and improving. This demo is mainly to let players feel the game flow; feel free to leave some feedback in the comment area :D</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I met a devil who wants to play a game with me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We will flip coins until one shows tails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once that happens, I can keep all the coins except for the one showing tails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All I need is to pay some coins in return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sounds like a good deal, doesn't it?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I flip a coin. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If heads, automatically flip another coin and repeat the process until tails. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If tails, I gain all the coins except for the one showing tails, and the round is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For every 5 rounds, the devil will charge me some coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can't wait to become a millionaire!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Devil's offer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every time the round is over, the devil offers three items for sale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I can use the coins I earned from the previous round to purchase those items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Those items will make my next round better!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The devil is too kind for me!</p>","developers":["Argue with Sheep"],"fullgame":{"appid":"34689